  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In support of the implementation of the National Plan for Sustainable Rehabilitation and Reconstruction (PRRES), the project will contribute to restore access to basic infrastructure  for a portion of the affected population in five target regions, and to strengthen the Government#s ability at the national, sectoral, and municipal levels throughout the country to respond to future disasters.</narrative>
  </description>
